title: [FEATURE] DEFAULT Bedrock Model Still Claude Sonnet 4

body (full text, not truncated):

### Problem Statement

DEFAULT Bedrock Model Still Claude Sonnet 4.

DEFAULT_BEDROCK_MODEL_ID = "us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0"

Even on the official Anthropic website, Sonnet 4 is nearing the end of its support period. It also appears that a notification has been sent regarding the discontinuation of the Bedock Model.

https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations

### Proposed Solution

_No response_

### Use Case

Since the default model is used if a model is not explicitly specified, it is considered critical.

